# The wheel zooms around the pointer, multiplicatively (12 percent a notch, within 0.4 .. 2.5) with no dead zone; a drag pans at once
# and never selects. A Standard game of four half-turns. `camexpect squareat` checks that the square under the pointer stays under it.
# Layout (1400x800): Versus (150,250); Standard row (905,224); Play (808,712); Submit (841,90).
wait 20
click 150 250        # Versus
wait 30
click 905 224        # Standard
wait 20
click 808 712        # Play
wait 120
clicksq 0 0 e2
wait 30
clicksq 0 0 e4
wait 30
click 841 90         # Submit
wait 60
clicksq 0 1 e7
wait 30
clicksq 0 1 e5
wait 30
click 841 90
wait 60
clicksq 0 2 g1
wait 30
clicksq 0 2 f3
wait 30
click 841 90
wait 60
clicksq 0 3 b8
wait 30
clicksq 0 3 c6
wait 30
click 841 90
wait 60
key HOME
wait 40
movesq 0 3 h8        # the pointer on a corner square of a board ...
wait 2
zoom?
capture camera-wheel-before
wheel 3              # ... three notches in: 1.12^3 = 1.40x, the square stays under the pointer
wait 2
zoom?
camexpect state Free
camexpect zoom 0.7 0.9
camexpect squareat 0 3 h8 pointer
capture camera-wheel-in-at-pointer
wheel -1
wait 2
zoom?
camexpect squareat 0 3 h8 pointer
wheel 0.3            # a trackpad's fractional tick counts at once
wait 2
zoom?
wheel -30            # far out: stops at 0.4
wait 2
zoom?
camexpect zoom 0.39 0.41
capture camera-wheel-out-limit
wheel 40             # far in: stops at 2.5
wait 2
zoom?
camexpect zoom 2.49 2.51
key HOME
wait 40
camexpect state Overview
drag 800 400 500 450 # a drag pans immediately (no 100 ms dead time) and the piece under the pointer is not picked up
wait 10
zoom?
camexpect state Free
capture camera-drag-pan
key HOME
wait 40
camexpect state Overview
